  "checkers": "checkers",
  "draughts": "draughts",
  "why_checkers": "Whether a checkers move is legal depends on every piece, whether a jump is open and a jump under way; no declared need can say it.",
  "howto_play": "Take a side, begin once both sides are taken, then move in turn until one side has no move left or resigns."
